Pet Peeves
:::

:::text id=petPeeveContent at=top-left width=476 height=320 offsetX=112 offsetY=300 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=18
• **Unscheduled Comms:** Avoid unscheduled interruptions for non-urgent matters.

• **Refusal Without Reasons:** Avoid rejecting ideas or proposals without explaining why.
:::

:::shape id=goldenRuleCard at=top-left width=540 height=450 offsetX=660 offsetY=200 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16
:::

:::icon id=goldenRuleIcon at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=692 offsetY=232 name=check-circle size=36 color=#10B981
:::

:::text id=goldenRuleHeader at=top-left width=400 height=40 offsetX=740 offsetY=236 preset=title align=left color=#10B981 fontSize=24
Golden Rules
:::

:::text id=goldenRuleContent at=top-left width=476 height=320 offsetX=692 offsetY=300 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=18
1. **Advance Notice:** Notify me beforehand for any synchronous check-ins.

2. **Reasoning & Alternatives:** Provide reasons for refusals and suggest alternative ideas when possible.
:::
